@startuml agentic-organization-enterprise-boundary
title Agentic Organization / Agentic Enterprise Boundary ; per ADR-ES-020 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Enterprise" as AE
class "Agentic Organization" as AO

AE --> AO : may comprise multiple
AO ..> AE : may be part of

note right
  Per ADR-ES-020 section 5 + AORG-NEG-004:
  - Agentic Organization is NOT Agentic Enterprise
  - Agentic Enterprise may comprise multiple Agentic Organizations
  - Agentic Organization does NOT automatically establish Agentic Enterprise
end note

@enduml
